SUMMARY:Call for Volunteers: Nature Center Camp Prep Day!
DESCRIPTION:Join Us for Nature Center Camp Prep Day!\nHey there! We’re looking for awesome volunteers to help get the Nature Center ready for camp season. It’s an in-person event packed with fun tasks like organizing craft supplies\, cleaning\, gardening\, and putting together a storage rack! \nLow Difficulty: Gardening in the front of our building and weeding our native plant garden\, sorting supplies and setting up indoor spaces\, cleaning\, sweeping\, and wiping down surfaces\, hanging artwork \nHigh difficulty: heavy lifting and assembly for storage racks. \nNote: our parking lot is being worked on right now\, so participants are asked to park on the local side street Saber Court or get dropped off. \nGreat for teens needing last minute volunteer hours before the end of the school year! \nCome for any span of time that works for you throughout the day! \nCOST: FREE \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/call-for-volunteers-nature-center-camp-prep-day/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,Lorrimer Sanctuary
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Call-for-Volunteers-2026-Nature-Center-Camp-Prep-Day.jpeg
