UID:10010914-1781355600-1781362800@njaudubon.org
SUMMARY:Release & Return: A Women’s Mindfulness River Walk
DESCRIPTION:Led by Diana Lapp\, Inner Strength Counseling Services\, LLC \nTake a mindful pause in nature and reconnect with yourself on this two-hour guided river walk for women. Beginning with grounding breathwork and meditation\, you’ll then embark on a silent\, slow-paced hike to the river\, noticing sights\, sounds\, and sensations along the trail. \nUsing the ACT-based “Leaves on a Stream” metaphor (ACT-Acceptance Commitment Therapy)\, each participant will collect a fallen leaf to symbolically release worries\, self-doubt\, or recurring thoughts into the flowing water. Journaling prompts and optional group conversation will help integrate the experience and explore new ways of relating to thoughts and stress.\nThe walk concludes with a mindful return to the trailhead\, giving you space to carry the calm and clarity back into daily life.\nReconnect\, reflect\, and let go — your calm awaits by the river. \nWHAT TO BRING: Water\, appropriate footwear\, and an optional blanket or mat. Journals and pens will be provided. \nNOTE: We move at the pace of the slowest hiker\, so the walk’s end time may vary slightly. \nCOST: $25 per participant. \n$5 from each registration will be donated to New Jersey Audubon in support of their conservation efforts and stewardship of local wildlife habitats. By participating\, attendees are not only investing in their own well-being\, but also contributing to the preservation of the natural spaces that make reflection\, restoration\, and connection possible. \nLOCATION: Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary\, 11 Hardscrabble Rd\, Bernardsville\, NJ 07924 \nREGISTER HERE: https://www.viewcy.com/event/release__return_a_w \nNature offers us space to breathe\, reflect\, and reconnect. Supporting New Jersey Audubon helps protect these sacred outdoor spaces so future generations can continue to gather\, learn\, and heal in nature.
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/release-return-a-womens-mindfulness-river-walk/
LOCATION:New Jersey Audubon’s Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary\, 11 Hardscrabble Road\, Bernardsville\, NJ\, 07924\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,Nature Walk,Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Release-Return-A-Womens-Mindfulness-River-Walk.jpg
GEO:40.7448693;-74.5523161
